      "values:originalText": "Omit “each type of *subsidy”, substitute “*residential care subsidy and\n*flexible care subsidy”.\n\nAmendments  Schedule 1\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nNo. 19, 2016\nAged Care Legislation Amendment (Increasing Consumer Choice) Act",
