      "dc:source": "aged-care-legislation-amendment-increasing-consumer-choice-act-2016.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\nHowever, any *unspent home care amount (which may include\nhome care subsidy) of a care recipient must be dealt with by an\napproved provider in accordance with the User Rights Principles.",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\nHowever, any *unspent home care amount (which may include\nhome care subsidy) of a care recipient must be dealt with by an\napproved provider in accordance with the User Rights Principles.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
