    {
      "@id": "concept:aged-care-legislation-amendment-increasing-consumer-choice-act-2016-sch-1-sec-72",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "72 Obligation to notify Secretary about home care services",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/aged-care-legislation-amendment-increasing-consumer-choice-act-2016#sch-1-sec-72"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "aged-care-legislation-amendment-increasing-consumer-choice-act-2016.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "aged-care-legislation-amendment-increasing-consumer-choice-act-2016.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "etc.\n(1)\nThis item applies if, immediately before the commencement time, an\nallocation of a place to an approved provider in respect of a particular\nhome care service is in effect.\n(2)\nThe approved provider is taken, on the commencement of this item, to\nhave notified the Secretary in relation to the service in accordance with\nsubsections 9-1A(1) to (3) of the new law.",
      "skos:definition": "etc.\n(1)\nThis item applies if, immediately before the commencement time, an\nallocation of a place to an approved provider in respect of a particular\nhome care service is in effect.\n(2)\nThe approved provider is taken, on the commencement of this item, to\nhave notified the Secretary in relation to the service in accordance with\nsubsections 9-1A(1) to (3) of the new law.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:aged-care-legislation-amendment-increasing-consumer-choice-act-2016-sch-1-sec-72-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:aged-care-legislation-amendment-increasing-consumer-choice-act-2016-sch-1-sec-72-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e37bad16c2ac6adbef401c5730b215da30195b43470cfd6754f7a4b2298d407a",
      "skos:note": "Notify Secretary about home care services",
      "dc:description": "Notification of service commencement"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/aged-care-legislation-amendment-increasing-consumer-choice-act-2016#sch-1-sec-72",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "72 Obligation to notify Secretary about home care services",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 26,
      "values:originalText": "etc.\n(1)\nThis item applies if, immediately before the commencement time, an\nallocation of a place to an approved provider in respect of a particular\nhome care service is in effect.\n(2)\nThe approved provider is taken, on the commencement of this item, to\nhave notified the Secretary in relation to the service in accordance with\nsubsections 9-1A(1) to (3) of the new law."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:aged-care-legislation-amendment-increasing-consumer-choice-act-2016-sch-1-sec-72-norm",
