      "dc:source": "aged-care-legislation-amendment-increasing-consumer-choice-act-2016.pdf, p.26",
      "values:originalText": "The repeal of section 10-2 of the Aged Care Act 1997 by this Schedule\napplies in relation to any approval of an aged care provider that is in\nforce at or after the commencement time.",
      "skos:definition": "The repeal of section 10-2 of the Aged Care Act 1997 by this Schedule\napplies in relation to any approval of an aged care provider that is in\nforce at or after the commencement time.",
      "cml:asserts": [
