      "skos:note": "Ceases allocation of place at commencement time"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/aged-care-legislation-amendment-increasing-consumer-choice-act-2016#sch-1-sec-76",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "76 Cessation of places for home care subsidy",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 27,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThis item applies if, immediately before the commencement time, an\nallocation of a place to an approved provider in respect of home care\nsubsidy is in effect.\n(2)\nAt the commencement time, the allocation of the place ceases to have\neffect."
    },
