      "dc:source": "aged-care-legislation-amendment-increasing-consumer-choice-act-2016.pdf, p.29",
      "values:originalText": "To avoid doubt, paragraph 63-1(1)(e) of the old law continues to apply\nin relation to a place allocated in respect of home care subsidy that is\ntransferred before the commencement time.",
      "skos:definition": "To avoid doubt, paragraph 63-1(1)(e) of the old law continues to apply\nin relation to a place allocated in respect of home care subsidy that is\ntransferred before the commencement time.",
      "cml:asserts": [
